<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Millenium Chemical started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Millenium Chemical started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said it started coverage of Millennium Chemicals Inc as near-term neutral and long-term buy.</p>
<p>-- The stock rose 3/8 to 22-7/8.</p>
